@startuml 18-seq-reconcile
!include _style.puml
title Recovery of failed customer synchronisation
autonumber
actor "crm-admin" as a
participant "Crm.Api" as api
participant "AdminAudit filter" as au
participant "IntegrationService" as is
database "crm-db" as db
participant "OutboxPublisher" as pub
participant "Temporal" as t

a -> api : POST /api/v1/integration/reconcile?olderThanMinutes=15
api -> au : endpoint filter (after authorization)
au -> is : ReconcileAsync(tenant, olderThan)
is -> db : mappings with status Failed,\nor Pending older than olderThan\nattempt = attempt + 1 -> Pending\nINSERT outbox OnboardingRequested(attempt)
au -> db : INSERT admin_audit (separate connection,\ncorrelation id included)
api --> a : count re-queued
pub -> t : start CustomerOnboarding:<tenant>:<id>:<attempt>
note right of t : New attempt number = new workflow id,\nso RejectDuplicate does not block the retry.\nERP create is idempotent (tenant + CRM id).
note over a, t
  Not yet available: reconcile endpoint for returns, retry of OrderFailed quotes.
  Fulfilment mirrors are re-pushed by ERP workflows instead.
end note
@enduml
